 *  11-Jul-2025     Pruthviraj               Passing init config to remote event sender/receiver\
 *  12-Aug-2025     Pruthviraj         remote sender/receiver changes according to configured protocol
 *  19-Aug-2025     Smit Prajapati           MOTADATA- 6740 Accurate Flow Monitoring Metrics by Decoupling from pmacct Aggregation
